[{"title":"南谷 其一","author":"胡居仁","text":"红尘应不到青山，新徙琴书入考槃。\n茅舍竹篱閒处乐，地炉松火静中安。\n数竿瘦竹风初静，满树寒梅雪未乾。\n却笑山人多逸兴，诗成袖手面层峦。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50930,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"南谷 其二","author":"胡居仁","text":"心迹高楼结搆幽，吾人于此足藏脩。\n北山崒嵂青云锁，南谷深沈紫雾浮。\n敬意毋荒时翼翼，善心不昧日休休。\n君今莫道功名事，争似箪瓢乐自优。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50931,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"李太尹求见自感","author":"胡居仁","text":"几年衰病卧林泉，势迫形驱苦自怜。\n白屋想应无孺子，琴堂有榻任高悬。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50932,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠李大章","author":"胡居仁","text":"春日载阳贫病减，抠衣直访郑公乡。\n几年不带看花眼，始向东风识海棠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50933,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"沙港舟中","author":"胡居仁","text":"卧病归舟越水浔，谁将风教振当今。\n幼儿只喜归家好，那识若翁忧世心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50934,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题风雩","author":"胡居仁","text":"五老峰南鹿洞前，和风满袂暮春天。\n道随日用无他慕，何独当年点也贤。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50935,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"枕流石","author":"胡居仁","text":"三峡涧头眠巨石，字有枕流留古迹。\n一枕千年永不移，清流昼夜无时息。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50936,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游孺子亭","author":"胡居仁","text":"汉竖当年不可维，先生明智已先知。\n如何不以几微处，说向陈公下榻时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50937,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠叶太守","author":"胡居仁","text":"皤矣庐州公，五十后相识。\n晚知道义尊，不为功名役。\n梅含雪里春，松秀霜前色。\n论学心无穷，赋诗情自适。\n我愿公再兴，作我生民益。\n来岁上京畿，亲睹吾皇极。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50938,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"复叶怿上舍","author":"胡居仁","text":"文风今喜盛吾番，谁似曾参为已多。\n鹤在九皋声自闻，凤翔千仞网难罗。\n每怜汉士训诂苦，更悯唐人诗句磨。\n南谷庸才甘世弃，日群麋鹿听樵歌。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50939,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠刘吏部建义庄","author":"胡居仁","text":"范氏当年建义庄，君家肯与续遗芳。\n信知积善功夫久，致使传家庆泽长。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50940,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"挽李大章","author":"胡居仁","text":"终始幽明一理间，士林今叹失儒冠。\n午风亭上人千古，萧瑟西风满玉湾。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50941,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"复高都宪","author":"胡居仁","text":"人道人生会晤易，我道人生会晤难。\n一代人才能有几，百年心事总相关。\n仰高峰下冰霜肃，芗水溪头风月閒。\n却念同胞多赤子，家书谁与报平安。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50942,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"咏洞前流水","author":"胡居仁","text":"洞前流水洞前流，洞里书生静里修。\n信是本原无一息，莫将道体更他求。\n有形可睹无形妙，今日应同昔日游。\n识得显微元不问，此心此理日相酬。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50943,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过子陵钓台","author":"胡居仁","text":"世祖中兴访故人，故人垂钓此江滨。\n一天明月无瑕翳，万古清风扫俗尘。\n宜以宾师居保傅，可将谋议定君臣。\n扁舟趋拜高台下，乐对先生笑白云。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50944,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"拜陆宣公祠","author":"胡居仁","text":"播迁暂展扶倾手，庸主难终济世才。\n千载家祠壮西浙，忠诚倍感后人怀。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50945,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"谢夏宪副正夫","author":"胡居仁","text":"一上高楼话古今，四檐凉雨碧云深。\n世间多少未了事，谁为乾坤体此心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50946,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"别松江郡侯诸公","author":"胡居仁","text":"驷牡不遑王事盬，野人归去白云閒。\n人心万古同此理，城外青山即岘山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50947,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"石桥晚坐","author":"胡居仁","text":"身随所寓贫何害，浓酒三杯落日残。\n半醒却来桥上坐，乾坤容我一人閒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50948,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"别同府于先生","author":"胡居仁","text":"粒我生民未敢休，乐天知命更何忧。\n他年了却公家事，向拟楼山共白头。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50949,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠五宜翁","author":"胡居仁","text":"富贵真为身外物，此心一动便成非。\n五宜却被公全了，我愿公今事事宜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50950,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠永福寺张僧","author":"胡居仁","text":"禅家直欲寻空去，却有张僧爱读书。\n此是秉彝千古性，谁言无极是真无。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50951,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"立春诗赠丘时雍","author":"胡居仁","text":"眼前时景初开泰，心里乾坤总属仁。\n昨日欢迎满城市，草堂分得几多春。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50952,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠致仕严掌教","author":"胡居仁","text":"轩前兰菊经霜后，雪里梅花更有神。\n每笑玄都桃李树，东风依旧欲争春。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50953,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠蔡推府致仕","author":"胡居仁","text":"脱屣功名能几人，丈夫何患志难伸。\n傍人莫讶归田早，云锦江头自有春。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50954,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题沙溪钓隐","author":"胡居仁","text":"钓隐闻君独擅名，我来细味钓中情。\n渭滨德老乾坤古，严子台高风月清。\n物理有常须定静，本心无累转虚明。\n傍人若问功名事，今古长安棋一枰。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50955,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄蘧行素","author":"胡居仁","text":"归儒峰下读书堂，势利纷纷已两忘。\n窗外梅花初破雪，檐前松竹几经霜。\n岂于末学矜多智，肯向遗经识大方。\n何日重来酬旧约，力扶吾道正天常。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50956,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"复俞监生","author":"胡居仁","text":"道体谁云远，敛之方寸间。\n幽人更何事，稳卧江东山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50957,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寓永福寺次夏宪副韵","author":"胡居仁","text":"自昔番昜号大邦，不应国士更无双。\n谁怜人世古今异，惟听僧钟晓暮撞。\n叠叠云山连远汉，茫茫烟水接长江。\n此心守得惺惺法，不待参禅万虑降。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50958,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寓居偶成","author":"胡居仁","text":"案上有书勤著眼，壶中无酒懒衔杯。\n心閒自有行窝乐，笑看灯花夜夜开。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50959,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"咏春秋","author":"胡居仁","text":"经世文成百代宗，一从轲死圣无踪。\n龙门妙契心传后，画笔徒劳拟化工。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50960,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"复余太尹","author":"胡居仁","text":"百里溪山不计程，使书遥辱过柴荆。\n姻㜕分内二家好，道义胸中万古情。\n单父琴归閒宓子，浔阳菊绽老渊明。\n知公已脱尘涂屣，策杖芝山日少萦。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50961,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"圣君曲","author":"朱诚泳","text":"圣人履天位，驭世应昌期。\n宝历千年运，神京万世基。\n梯航来职贡，海岳拱神祇。\n常道陈中夏，仁恩洽四夷。\n仪文唐制度，官属汉威仪。\n气正三辰顺，年登百谷滋。\n河清龟出洛，日暖凤鸣岐。\n大地歌谣满，唐虞今在兹。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50962,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宛转歌","author":"朱诚泳","text":"夜月明行舟，琴更清女郎。\n元是钟情物，风前乍听难。\n为情歌宛转，此身今已亡。\n于君有冥契，愿作双鸳鸯。\n长太息相看，泪沾臆茫茫。\n造物竟谁尸，恨不生逢王。\n敬伯歌宛转，宛转悲且长。\n红颜易零落，古今同一伤。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50963,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"明月引","author":"朱诚泳","text":"青天有月兮照八荒。\n银汉无云兮流素光。\n平分寒暑兮变炎凉。\n几人欢乐兮几悲伤。\n叹明月之弗改，念人生之靡常。\n或醉饱于夏屋，或困敝于康庄。\n一瓢寒士，千乘侯王。\n泥涂囚虏，珠翠名倡。\n或安居于甲第，或流落于他乡。\n百年能几，毕竟亡羊。\n惟达人之知命，且对月而衔觞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50964,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江上曲","author":"朱诚泳","text":"君为南越儿，妾乃东吴女。\n江上一相逢，目成心已许。\n与君欲相语，奈此舟中人。\n到岸各分散，悠悠恨此身。\n风高波浪险，极目孤篷转。\n重晤良独难，万里天涯远。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50965,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春游曲 其一","author":"朱诚泳","text":"车马乘春出，莺花触眼新。\n秋千忽飞起，故故看游人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50966,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春游曲 其二","author":"朱诚泳","text":"走马章台路，红尘一骑飞。\n美人招素手，楼上唤郎归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50967,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春游曲 其三","author":"朱诚泳","text":"晓色分杨柳，春阴护牡丹。\n王孙驰骏马，多是醉中看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50968,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春游曲 其四","author":"朱诚泳","text":"新柳迎游骑，飞花趁酒瓯。\n年年三二月，烂醉曲江头。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50969,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春游曲 其五","author":"朱诚泳","text":"楼外江山丽，城边锦绣新。\n春光浓似酒，醉杀浪游人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50970,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"鸡鸣曲","author":"朱诚泳","text":"沈沈漏箭催残更，扶桑日出天鸡鸣。\n羲和叱驭起苍震，坐令万国生光明。\n角角再鸣声未已，万国祼生都唤起。\n可怜驱入利名场，蝇营尽被鸡催死。\n我愿人家莫畜鸡，胶胶风雨不须啼。\n威凤来仪天下乐，日日窗前闻喜鹊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50971,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"对酒歌","author":"朱诚泳","text":"人生埃壒内，忽忽如梦中。\n三万六千日，所期安得同。\n枝上花正开，风前花又落。\n羲驭不我留，及时胡不乐。\n君不见三闾大夫誇独醒，形容憔悴江潭行。\n回风歌罢葬鱼腹，到底只留身后名。\n又不见伯伦荷锸身相随，生死有命信所之。\n洁身旷达两何有，毕竟得失还归谁。\n荣悴升沈若翻手，千古贤愚同一朽。\n昨朝绿鬓映朱颜，今日苍髯成皓首。\n秋月春光不等閒，何如且罄樽中酒。\n樽中酒，岂徒然，会须一饮吸百川。\n白日西驰坐成夜，休问安期与偓佺。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50972,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"古意 其一","author":"朱诚泳","text":"君好堤边柳，妾好岭上松。\n堤柳吐轻絮，飞去无定踪。\n不如松有操，郁郁傲寒冬。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50973,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"古意 其二","author":"朱诚泳","text":"君好江上舟，妾好岸边树。\n舟行遇风波，飘泊无常处。\n何如树不移，风波自来去。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50974,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"楼上曲","author":"朱诚泳","text":"东风吹春春欲阑，纷纷香雪梨花残。\n美人倚阑娇不语，翠袖笼寒懒轻举。\n尘封锦柱暗银筝，那忍弹成肠断声。\n掩袂含羞抱幽怨，怕见雕梁语双燕。\n蹙损双蛾思转迷，粉痕满面伤春啼。\n金莲缓步下楼去，飞絮游丝荡心绪。\n巫阳望断楚天遥，行雨行云在何处。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50975,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"远游篇","author":"朱诚泳","text":"至人思远游，远游竟何之。\n聊乘汗漫风，直与神仙期。\n晨兴食方丈，暮归宿瑶池。\n凭虚弄日月，剑佩光陆离。\n渴饮九霄露，饥餐千岁芝。\n平头看星斗，挥手谢尘羁。\n欢忻朝帝座，指麾役灵祇。\n归来驭元气，飞云亦追随。\n步虚振金石，天风吹鬓丝。\n两仪与终始，三光共盈亏。\n茫茫尘海人，蚩蚩讵能知。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50976,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"苦热行","author":"朱诚泳","text":"赤云喷火烧长天，蟾宫老桂飞苍烟。\n金乌自恨具毛羽，白虎喘杀知谁怜。\n万山烘透销青翠，四海波乾欲平地。\n苍龙鳞甲隐虫蛆，竟日泥蟠嗟殄瘁。\n况是南州瘴疠乡，火山炎海连天黄。\n著人毒热若汤火，灼我肌肤成炙疮。\n铁甲磨穿藏虮虱，万苦千辛死无日。\n蛮人退去幸生还，一级微名君尚惜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50977,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"渭城少年行","author":"朱诚泳","text":"洛下春深柳絮飞，渭城少年应忆归。\n马蹄偶入城南陌，相逢却是长安客。\n为言前日发秦台，而翁传语需君来。\n千门万户燕皆至，北苑南园花正开。\n年少寻春须及早，挥鞭疾上长安道。\n一路春光绝可怜，懵腾忽过斗城边。\n两两新妆临渭水，纷纷游骑满秦川。\n秦川自昔羡繁华，王孙公子争豪誇。\n门开朱户星初出，燕设青楼日未斜。\n倚醉联镳过戚里，九衢见者皆兴起。\n玉辔摇风马更骄，斗鸡赌得肯相饶。\n閒寻红粉来金市，喜听黄鹂过灞桥。\n桥下倡家新酒熟，解鞍就向倡家宿。\n美人纤手弄琵琶，酒边双脸蒸红霞。\n黄金掷与买今夕，少年肯负秦川花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50978,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"轻薄篇","author":"朱诚泳","text":"末世多轻薄，轻薄良可嗤。\n昂昂倚门第，行行恃先基。\n金多忽贫贱，尚肯恤癃疲。\n气豪蔑贤圣，讵知慕轩羲。\n一餐烹九鼎，下箸犹嗟咨。\n被服极纨绮，犹云匪新奇。\n千金买艳妾，色衰竟弃之。\n四方致名马，一蹶终见遗。\n结交出肺肝，盟言日星垂。\n片言苟不合，对面生嫌疑。\n仲尼称匹夫，造化呼小儿。\n伯阳道德小，孟轲仁义亏。\n孙吴岂谙兵，卢扁岂知医。\n陋兹轻薄子，宜为君子规。\n薄方惊蝶翅，轻于风柳枝。\n愿言执其人，为君投四夷。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50979,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"公子行","author":"朱诚泳","text":"白面青瞳照秋水，豪华知是诸公子。\n金鞍玉辔紫丝鞭，双双笑语东风里。\n越罗披体试春衣，鹘似身轻马似飞。\n春色薰人随处好，纵游直过妓楼西。\n美人楼上亲招手，公子风流能过否。\n绿杨树底繫花骢，指点银瓶来索酒。\n笑将綵胜结同心，醉来一掷双南金。\n翠帏锦帐恣欢谑，梦入阳台何处寻。\n五更却恨鸡声早，马上归来踏芳草。\n弯弓更过曲江头，争拾金丸逐飞鸟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50980,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西城路","author":"朱诚泳","text":"西城路，半是平田半坟墓。\n平田渐少坟渐多，酸风苦雨泣铜驼。\n百岁光阴驹过隙，营营终日将如何。\n人生少年胡不乐，世间那有苏仙鹤。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50981,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"燕燕于飞","author":"朱诚泳","text":"燕燕何处来，营巢寻旧主。\n斜冲碧柳烟，低掠青芜雨。\n逐絮绕回塘，衔泥过远浦。\n汉灰无复然，莫效当时舞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50982,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"苦哉远征人","author":"朱诚泳","text":"苦哉远征人，荷戈西出秦。\n以身自许国，举目谁为亲。\n阴云翳落日，白草迷黄尘。\n三伏不知暑，四月那见春。\n射生充早食，卧草当夜茵。\n风高弓力劲，霜重铁衣新。\n主将号令肃，部伍催行频。\n提兵誓灭敌，僇力敢顾身。\n固知在家乐，宁厌行戍贫。\n他日侯王贵，绘像登麒麟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50983,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋夜长","author":"朱诚泳","text":"秋夜长，明月光，露华洗天金气凉。\n寒虫候雁两何苦，声逐西风来枕傍。\n彷徨披衣坐夜深，丁东又听捣衣砧。\n残烛荧荧更漏静，无端万事皆萦心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50984,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"遥夜吟","author":"朱诚泳","text":"秋夜一何遥，灯烬炉烟灭。\n低下水精帘，含情对明月。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50985,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"估客乐","author":"朱诚泳","text":"郎船下江水，乘风疾若飞。\n与侬各分袂，掩泣牵郎衣。\n手拔黄金钗，临岐赠郎别。\n愿郎心似金，坚持莫轻折。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50986,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"将军行","author":"朱诚泳","text":"衔命西来专斧钺，远出萧关探虎穴。\n铁骢夜踏黑河冰，金戈冷射关山月。\n将军令严健儿勇，直捣长驱争鼓勇。\n阴山北遁穹庐空，惟剩牛羊满丘陇。\n忆昔我军多战没，风雨啾啾鬼宵哭。\n于今汉将守边城，翻役官军收战骨。\n露布星驰达冕旒，将军承诏独封侯。\n争誇一代麒麟阁，谁念沙场万髑髅。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50987,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"捣衣曲","author":"朱诚泳","text":"井梧叶坠金风起，满庭明月凉於水。\n为念儿夫戍玉关，尘满征衣谁与洗。\n我有冰缣三两疋，胼手殷勤为君织。\n欲制寒衣远寄将，双杵拈来对砧石。\n捣乱西风续又鸣，一声声里寓幽情。\n夜深玉腕痛且困，不知露下将三更。\n裁缝已就凭谁寄，走马朝来有边吏。\n一行书染泪千行，寒到君边衣到未。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50988,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夜宴谣","author":"朱诚泳","text":"良夜沈沈宫漏促，两阶庭燎烧银烛。\n上宾入座气如虹，帘外佳人面如玉。\n一举飞觥累十觞，凤笙龙管声锵锵。\n满堂珠翠照人眼，酒边尤物令人狂。\n风动俄然银烛灭，暗中求与同心结。\n红颜变色绝冠缨，壮士羞颜冷於铁。\n君王一笑许终欢，保全宾客曾无难。\n夜深痛醉各归去，感恩直欲倾心肝。\n从来燕礼惟三爵，三爵既过多失错。\n不醉无归乃所私，饮而不乱真为乐。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50989,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"农夫谣","author":"朱诚泳","text":"我昨过农家，农夫于我陈。\n嗟嗟天地间，而唯农苦辛。\n春耕土埋足，夏耘汗沾巾。\n秋成能几何，仅得比比邻。\n老农惟二子，输边辛苦均。\n大儿援灵夏，性命逐车轮。\n小儿戍甘泉，身首犯边尘。\n老妇卖薪去，老农空一身。\n荒村绝鸡犬，四壁罄仓囷。\n公家不我恤，里胥动生嗔。\n鞭笞且不免，敢冀周吾贫。\n我农老垂死，甘为地下人。\n尚祈孙子辈，犹为平世民。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50990,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"树中草","author":"朱诚泳","text":"草木非同气，托根犹可生。\n如何兄与弟，同气却无情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50991,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"独不见","author":"朱诚泳","text":"举头望仙山，孤坐开水殿。\n芳草自成茵，落花复如霰。\n轻云逐翔鸾，绿树来新燕。\n光景满目前，杳然独不见。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50992,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}}]